    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help Nazrin solve the incident of the mysterious puzzle craze!</strong></h2><br><i>A new craze has swept Gensokyo. What started as a minor fad in the Human Village has turned into an obsession that has spread throughout the land, finding devotees even among the various low-level youkai.<br><br>What has caught everybody's attention is a puzzle game in which a grid of squares is notated with numerical clues, with the solution yielding a picture. It is a simple to learn, addictive game, and can be easily spread through cards upon which the puzzles are drawn.<br><br>Sensing that something is amiss with this situation, Shou Toramaru sends Nazrin to learn more about the puzzle craze, and to investigate its origins.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955020/extras/986e2eaf643efedea742151141a92fe3.avif?t=1722628840\" width=520 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring Your Puzzle Skills!</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve over 100 Touhou-themed puzzles throughout various modes like Story Mode, Puzzle Mode, and Mosaic Mode.<br></li><li>Select from several puzzle environments and music tracks.<br></li><li>Take advantage of features such as Hints and Quick Saves as you work through the puzzles.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955020/extras/986e2eaf643efedea742151141a92fe3.avif?t=1722628840\" width=520 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get To Work(shop)!</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own puzzles and submit them to the Workshop.<br></li><li>Play puzzles submitted by others.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Help Nazrin solve the incident of the mysterious puzzle craze!</strong></h2><br><i>A new craze has swept Gensokyo. What started as a minor fad in the Human Village has turned into an obsession that has spread throughout the land, finding devotees even among the various low-level youkai.<br><br>What has caught everybody's attention is a puzzle game in which a grid of squares is notated with numerical clues, with the solution yielding a picture. It is a simple to learn, addictive game, and can be easily spread through cards upon which the puzzles are drawn.<br><br>Sensing that something is amiss with this situation, Shou Toramaru sends Nazrin to learn more about the puzzle craze, and to investigate its origins.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955020/extras/986e2eaf643efedea742151141a92fe3.avif?t=1722628840\" width=520 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring Your Puzzle Skills!</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve over 100 Touhou-themed puzzles throughout various modes like Story Mode, Puzzle Mode, and Mosaic Mode.<br></li><li>Select from several puzzle environments and music tracks.<br></li><li>Take advantage of features such as Hints and Quick Saves as you work through the puzzles.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955020/extras/986e2eaf643efedea742151141a92fe3.avif?t=1722628840\" width=520 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get To Work(shop)!</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own puzzles and submit them to the Workshop.<br></li><li>Play puzzles submitted by others.</li></ul>",
